+    `unknown setting(s): count_extra_dirs` (O7; reproduced, section 2);
+  - after a change to a module of `devtools/` or `skills/`: rebuild the plugins, run
+    `write`, and commit `.devtools/components/` with the change.
+- "Gates", two rows:
